OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 28 DEC
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch traces a path
OL,6,     Gtowards Rachmaninov's Rhapsody on
OL,7,     Ga Theme of Paganini, a single-
OL,8,     Gmovement work for piano and
OL,9,     Gorchestra, based on one of
OL,10,     GPaganini's Violin Caprices.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GA service of Choral Evensong with
OL,13,     GCarols for Christmas Eve from St
OL,14,     GMartin-in-the-Fields, London,
OL,15,     Gwith music by Bob Chilcott and
OL,16,     GJohn Rutter.
OL,17,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,18,     GJoin our community of jazz
OL,19,     Glovers. Alyn Shipton is waiting
OL,20,     Gfor your requests: email
OL,21,     Gjrr@bbc.co.uk or use
OL,22,     G_jazzrecordrequests on social.
