OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French is joined by
OL,6,     GBaroque flaustist Ashley Solomon
OL,7,     Gto explore some of the
OL,8,     Gextraordinary flutes in the
OL,9,     Gcollection of the German musical
OL,10,     Ginstrument enthusiast Peter Spohr.
OL,11,G1800FWords and Music
OL,12,     GMusic by Berlioz, Virgil Thomson
OL,13,     Gand Tchaikovsky inspired by
OL,14,     GByron's poetry, and readings by
OL,15,     GRobert Glenister from his
OL,16,     Gwritings, in today's programme
OL,17,     Gcelebrating Byron .
